{"skill":{"slug":"frontend-design-3","displayName":"Frontend Design"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770862472442,"changelog":"Initial release of frontend-design skill focused on distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces.\n\n- Provides detailed design principles to avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics.\n- Outlines process for context-driven, bold conceptual direction.\n- Specifies typography, color, motion, layout, and visual detail guidelines for memorable designs.\n- Clearly lists anti-patterns to avoid common, uninspired choices.\n- Sets high standards for code quality, creativity, and visual impact in every output.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3622,"sha256":"b19efbc330acb7e4d0650ad402a96adf2a45af614141d64ab50c97036e9ce05b","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1511,"sha256":"c6a40d794940f0625450e2339060be47449860a66c2b2f5207ee0fbf242cfe3f","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":false,"checkedAt":1789062218208,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f46d77936111ac763d64f5eeb5c0978f5496e69d6fbd1c719766fe9d7d880204","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f46d77936111ac763d64f5eeb5c0978f5496e69d6fbd1c719766fe9d7d880204","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: frontend-design-3\nVersion: 0.1.0\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. The `SKILL.md` file provides detailed instructions for an AI agent to generate high-quality, distinctive frontend designs, focusing on aesthetic guidelines and anti-patterns. There are no instructions for data exfiltration, unauthorized command execution, network calls, persistence mechanisms, or any form of prompt injection aimed at subverting the agent's security or intended function. All content is aligned with the stated purpose of creating creative frontend interfaces.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163372875},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789062218208},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a frontend design guidance file with no bundled code, network behavior, credential handling, or persistence.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Any file-writing implied by 'implement working code' is proportional to the stated frontend-building purpose and depends on a user's requested coding task.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The inspected package contains only a markdown SKILL.md file and no installer, executable script, dependency declaration, or remote payload reference.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to frontend design work and do not attempt to override evaluator controls, alter safety policy, access private data, or redirect unrelated agent behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, background execution, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, memory modification, credential use, or long-running worker behavior is present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact's purpose is to guide creation of distinctive frontend interfaces, and its instructions stay within design, implementation quality, and aesthetic choices.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"This appears safe to install as a design-assistance skill. It will influence frontend styling and implementation choices when invoked, so users should expect opinionated visual guidance, but I found no hidden execution or sensitive access behavior.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789062218208}}}}}